278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (Workers in workshops, laboratories and industrial environments must wear personal protective equipment to reduce the risk of injury. However, some workers may forget or ignore these requirements.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (Traditional monitoring depends heavily on supervisors, who may miss violations because of distractions, large work areas or demanding workloads. Manual incident recording can also be slow and inconsistent.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (Supervisors therefore need a reliable system that can check safety compliance in real time, identify workers and maintain accurate incident records. AI SafeGuard addresses this need through automated PPE detection, facial recognition, immediate alerts and incident logging.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
